{
    "title": "Renovate AI - Home Remodel",
    "description": "Transform your space with Renovate AI, the #1 AI app for photorealistic home design. \r\nOur technology makes visualizing and planning your interior and exterior renovations cheaper, faster, easier, and smarter.\r\n\r\nExperience the future of home design with our polished, user-friendly interface. \r\nPowered by 10+ AI models, Renovate AI offers specialized tools for every aspect of your project. Customize renovation levels, focus on specific areas, or reimagine entire rooms \u2013 the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nUnleash your creativity with 100+ curated styles, custom prompts, and a color selector. Our unique style transfer feature lets you apply bedroom, kitchen, or home exterior designs directly to your space. Dedicated paint tools for walls, exteriors, and kitchen backsplashes give you precise control.\r\n\r\nExplore our Landscaping AI model with 40+ styles to perfect your outdoor areas. From simple tweaks to complex overhauls, Renovate AI makes it all possible.\r\nFind the perfect d\u00e9cor with our visual object search, connecting you directly to purchasable items. Enjoy lightning-fast renders with 10 free generations daily. \r\nYour premium subscription includes access to our desktop and web apps.\r\n\r\nJoin our vibrant community to share your designs and get inspired. Our entire team provides premium support, ensuring you're never alone in your design journey.\r\nRest easy knowing your images are securely stored in the cloud and never used for AI training. Simple things are simple, complex things are possible with Renovate AI \u2013 your ultimate partner in home transformation.\r\nDownload now and start redesigning your space like a pro!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Transform your space with Renovate AI, the #1 AI app for photorealistic home design. <br>Our technology makes visualizing and planning your interior and exterior renovations cheaper, faster, easier, and smarter.<br><br>Experience the future of home design with our polished, user-friendly interface. <br>Powered by 10+ AI models, Renovate AI offers specialized tools for every aspect of your project. Customize renovation levels, focus on specific areas, or reimagine entire rooms \u2013 the choice is yours.<br><br>Unleash your creativity with 100+ curated styles, custom prompts, and a color selector. Our unique style transfer feature lets you apply bedroom, kitchen, or home exterior designs directly to your space. Dedicated paint tools for walls, exteriors, and kitchen backsplashes give you precise control.<br><br>Explore our Landscaping AI model with 40+ styles to perfect your outdoor areas. From simple tweaks to complex overhauls, Renovate AI makes it all possible.<br>Find the perfect d\u00e9cor with our visual object search, connecting you directly to purchasable items. Enjoy lightning-fast renders with 10 free generations daily. <br>Your premium subscription includes access to our desktop and web apps.<br><br>Join our vibrant community to share your designs and get inspired. Our entire team provides premium support, ensuring you&#39;re never alone in your design journey.<br>Rest easy knowing your images are securely stored in the cloud and never used for AI training. Simple things are simple, complex things are possible with Renovate AI \u2013 your ultimate partner in home transformation.<br>Download now and start redesigning your space like a pro!",
